WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.387
The Criminal Code irony.

00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:08.437
Canada's Criminal Code contains no specific offence for retaliating against a whistleblower.

00:00:08.437 --> 00:00:13.475
A government employee who exposes billions in fraud has no legal shield.

00:00:13.475 --> 00:00:17.625
The person who fires them faces no criminal consequence.

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:22.662
The law protects the institution, not the individual who tries to fix it.
